// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ashwin Lannister 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P785040331" "Ashwin Lannister"
// ProfessionString :
"P3190405071" "Hero Corps Representative"
// DescriptionString :
"P2387670343" "Ashwin Lannister is rising quickly through the ranks of Hero Corps, largely due to his experience during the Rikti War. As a military intelligence analyst, Ashwin helped coordinate the defense of Washington, D.C. He was also one of the handful of analysts allowed direct access to Rikti prisoners. Since joining Hero Corps, however, he's been assigned some of the lesser but still dangerous villain groups, like the Council. He finds them rather fascinating, and he's working hard to compile a fuller understanding of the group's beliefs and goals. With the help of the heroes he works with, he's having a fair degree of success."
// WrongAllianceString :
"P2795972436" "I don't talk to villains, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P278674640" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some assignments I could use your help on.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2313077683" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is trouble to be dealt with.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P108361192" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>My analysis has uncovered some activity I think you'll find interesting.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P548813915" "I wish I could help, but you should be talking to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P425671952" "I had hoped you would come to me, {HeroName}. I have a lot of information, and I need dependable help to deal with it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4044657176" "Together, we cleaned out my files, {HeroName}. Thanks, and good luck."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2809932050" "Sorry, but Hero Corps has strict policies regulating the number of assignments a hero can take on."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3408401390" "I've got a juicy case for you, but it's classified Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P860268407" "This is going to be a profitable friendship, I can tell. I have access to some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you should take a look at. I am also providing a communication device so that you can contact me more easily."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3648100323" "You just made my A-list, {HeroName}. I have access to some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you should take a look at."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P449417540" "You are ready for greater challenges, {HeroName}. Don't forget about your friends in the Hero Corps."
// LocationString :
"P224065995" "Independence Port"
// IntroString :
"P1644229884" "I'd like you to introduce yourself to Ashwin Lannister from Hero Corps. They may be a for-profit organization, but they get the job done. He is currently focused on the Council and the Warriors. He has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2879003189" "Choose Ashwin Lannister"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1019037081" "Hero Corps doesn't always get the best press, but they are effective. Good luck, and keep your eyes open."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2249213581" "A friend of mine, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>{ContactName}</A>, would like to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3647732306" "I have some suggestions for new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A>, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


