// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Christine Lansdale 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4143221868" "Christine Lansdale"
// ProfessionString :
"P691356648" "Military Analyst"
// DescriptionString :
"P2432356357" "Christine Lansdale is a retired Air Force officer who now works as a military analyst for the armed forces as well as several private groups. She has recently begun doing some consulting for the Freedom Corps, whose non-profit ideology she prefers to the corporate culture of Hero Corps, one of her long-standing clients. Christine specializes in demystifying the military process for civilian companies and heroes who are trying to work with the armed forces. She has many friends and contacts on both sides of the fence, so she serves as a valuable intermediary between the secretive and suspicious military and the prideful and sometimes reckless heroes."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3943848795" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's get to work.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3360858411" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is a lot I want to put on your plate, {HeroName}.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1499235807" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Things are definitely heating up.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3580068426" "Until you are cleared, you should be talking with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2512460275" "The first thing I want you to know, {HeroName}, is that I can make your job a lot easier."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P494988693" "I have no assignments left, {HeroName}. You are very efficient."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2017566236" "I don't think I can give you another assignment yet. You'll have to finish some of the ones you have."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P746745559" "I got a good tip, but I'd rather hand it over to you after you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2850838191" "You are a solid hero, and a good friend. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>New Enhancements</A> are available for you to requisition. Don't hesitate to call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3896930478" "I am proud to have been working with you, {HeroName}. I have approval to make more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> available to you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P598363120" "Our assignments together are complete, {HeroName}. Well done."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3049051970" "My friend Christine Lansdale is a military consultant who often helps heroes like you deal with the Sky Raiders and the Family. Through her military contacts, she has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2668521487" "Choose Christine Lansdale"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4232917829" "Christine is efficient and easy to work with. I am sure you will find her a useful contact."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2568537511" "I want you to meet <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>{ContactName}</A>, a contact of mine."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2843487767" "You should speak to one of these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A>."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


