// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Collin Larson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1037698486" "Collin Larson"
// ProfessionString :
"P3575666440" "Cybernetics Expert"
// DescriptionString :
"P258605738" "Colin Larson is one of those people who seems to be always near greatness but never in the spotlight. A talented, driven engineer, Colin was one of the workhorses of the cybernetics revolution. He helped develop the first fully robotic artificial limbs and was a key member of the team that perfected nerve machine integration. Yet, for all his hard work, Colin remains an unsung hero of the scientific community. This may be due to his habit of getting his hands dirty with matters not scientific in nature. For several years now, Colin has been fascinated by the city's heroes, and he spends almost all his free time working with them to catch criminals, especially cybernetics thieves like the Freakshow. When he's honest with himself, Colin has to admit that he is beginning to find this work much more rewarding than his research."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P566684198" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is a lot going on.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3426511900" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The city is hopping today.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1707158684" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You are going to have your work cut out for you.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3658908651" "As much as I would like to chat, you really should be speaking to {LastContactName} at this point in your career."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2403414606" "The chance to work with heroes like you is worth any amount of hassle. I hope we have a lot of success together, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3991966988" "I have nothing more for you, {HeroName}. You have cleaned me out of missions."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3200532199" "You need to finish some of the things you've started, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1824163017" "Are you interested in taking on some tougher jobs? You'll need to reach Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2684809322" "It is a pleasure working with you, my friend. I have some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you should find useful. Please call if there's anything more I can do for you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2897491138" "You are a great hero, {HeroName}. I have more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you might find interesting."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P649607630" "You have moved past my level of influence, {HeroName}. It's been a pleasure."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2785584437" "You should go see Colin Larson. He's a cybernetics expert and a real friend to heroes everywhere. He knows a great deal about the Freakshow and the Family. He also has Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P41190206" "Choose Collin Larson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P4246210575" "Collin is well suited to work with a hero like you, {HeroName}."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2855654918" "You should meet a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> I know."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2019869083" "I have some more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contact</A> suggestions for you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


