// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Eliza Thorpe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P181550111" "Eliza Thorpe"
// ProfessionString :
"P436819131" "Missing Persons Investigator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1775503079" "Eliza Thorpe works for the city's Missing Persons Bureau, an agency that specializes in finding the lost and preventing the kidnappings that occur all too frequently in Paragon City. A former FBI agent, Eliza moved to Paragon City to search for her parents, who went missing just after the Rikti War. She never found them, but her life was changed forever when she learned how many disappearances occur in Paragon City every day. She and her colleagues work hand in hand with the city's heroes to try and stem the tide of kidnappings, but it is definitely an uphill battle. Eliza remains hopeful that the situation will improve if she keeps fighting the good fight, but she realizes she'll need plenty of help."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2427638865" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Things just keep getting stranger and stranger.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1935472875" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You aren't going to believe what I have to tell you.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2405954888" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I hope you can help me with a couple problems, {HeroName}.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2567160590" "Sorry, but I'm right in the middle of something. I think you should see if {LastContactName} is free."
// FirstVisitString :
"P675932579" "Looking forward to putting an end to some of this city's chaos with you, {HeroName}."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2881399704" "I have nothing more to assign you. Thank you so much for all you've done."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P18768424" "It looks like you're already up to your eyeballs in work."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P155549309" "I've got something, but I don't feel comfortable giving it to you before you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2903708720" "I'm proud to call you a friend, {HeroName}. I have access to some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you should find useful. If you get into trouble, please call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3275447401" "I find heroes like you quite inspirational, {HeroName}. <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>I hope these new Enhancements will help.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4067759031" "Thanks for all your help, {HeroName}. You need to move on now."
// LocationString :
"P3637129972" "Talos Island"
// IntroString :
"P592997884" "Eliza Thorpe from the Missing Persons Bureau has asked to see you. She could really use your help with the Devouring Earth and the Rikti. She needs to know what part they may be playing in the disappearances of Paragon City citizens. She has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2713727185" "Choose Eliza Thorpe"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2529449820" "Eliza will work very hard to help you. She is extremely dedicated to returning Paragon City to the hands of the people who live here."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4090372748" "A <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friend</A> of mine would like to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P221522745" "A couple more of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends</A> are hoping to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


