// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Laura Brunetti 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2189303684" "Laura Brunetti"
// ProfessionString :
"P2847376745" "Historian"
// DescriptionString :
"P3474710585" "Laura Brunetti is a historian who specializes in rare books and ancient tomes. She's fluent in over a dozen languages and has been the curator of the Brunetti Archives since she took them over from her father twenty years ago. The archives contain the world's largest collection of books related to the supernatural world. Laura herself is a practicing magician, and most of her spells are used to preserve her books and unearth the lost secrets within them. When she discovers something useful in her studies, she passes it along to one of the many heroes she knows. Laura's the first to admit that she wouldn't want to find herself face to face with the villain groups she studies. But she enjoys fighting evil in her own way, especially since the Rikti War, when her archives narrowly escaped destruction."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2861155427" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've learned something dreadful, {HeroName}.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1120125164" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I want you to delve deeper into some mysteries for me.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2524174050" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I hope you will see fit to assist me with these matters.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2036399381" "I believe you should still be speaking with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4279502884" "{HeroName}, I look forward to getting to the bottom of many a mystical mystery together."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4266565351" "I'm afraid that I am all out of mysteries for us to solve together."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1192484726" "You're already booked up!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3377036417" "If you can get to Security Level {Level}, I'm sure I can come up with some interesting assignments."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4075375307" "I am pleased to have struck up a friendship with you, {HeroName}. I have a number of new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> I am happy to make available to you. Please keep in touch."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3956448684" "I feel closer to you than ever, {HeroName}. Time for a number of new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> to be made available to you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P66382755" "Sadly, our work together is done, {HeroName}. Good luck to you in your forthcoming endeavors."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P356272759" "Laura Brunetti could be a useful contact to you, {HeroName}. Her supernatural library is unmatched, and she is an expert on the Banished Pantheon and the Circle of Thorns. She has Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3670705502" "Choose Laura Brunetti"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P186783425" "Laura has a keen mind and loves to get to the bottom of things. I'm certain you will find work with her enlightening."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3844600510" "A friend of mine,<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>{ContactName}</A>, would like to make your acquaintance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2972444732" "There are some more<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> I would like you to be aware of."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


