// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Laurie Pennington 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P316593045" "Laurie Pennington"
// ProfessionString :
"P1473814860" "Freedom Corps Contact"
// DescriptionString :
"P1997516498" "Ask Laurie Pennington to name the greatest hero who ever lived, and she'll tell you it was her father, the Golden Conqueror. When he was killed in the Rikti War, Laurie felt that the best way to honor his memory was to volunteer for the Freedom Corps. She loves her work with the Corps, and she's come to admire some of the heroes she works with almost as much as her father. Many in the police department and the hero community remember Laurie's dad with great fondness, so she frequently has access to a great deal of information that wouldn't be made available to any other Freedom Corp representative."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P3932630650" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some serious situations that could use your attention.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3491482199" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Trouble is rampant in the city, {HeroName}.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1164109886" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some problems I want you to take a look at.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2268402375" "Sorry, hero, I think that {LastContactName} still needs your help."
// FirstVisitString :
"P35765707" "Let's restore Paragon City to its former glory for all those who have fallen, like my father."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3591374203" "I have no more tasks for you, {HeroName}. Thank you for all your help."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3740989548" "I'd be in for a demotion if I let you take on any more work."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3127936692" "I'd like you to take on some tougher cases, but you'll need to reach Security Level {Level} first."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P773257421" "You are a good person, {HeroName}, and a good friend. Freedom Corps has granted you access to some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A> Please call me if you are ever in need."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P725007032" "My father would have been proud to know you, {HeroName}. I had you cleared for access to additional Freedom Corps <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P905081468" "Thank you again for helping me keep alive the memory of my father and the other fallen heroes. Our work together is done."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3363528642" "There's a woman named Laurie Pennington over at the Freedom Corps who'd like to meet you. Apparently, she's heard good things. She can provide excellent information about the Council and the Warriors. She has access to Training Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3473359199" "Choose Laurie Pennington"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1369903645" "The work that Laurie and the Freedom Corps are doing is exemplary."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2139547120" "I think you ought to meet a friend of mine, <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>{ContactName}.</A>"
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P326424695" "You should speak to one of these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A>, {HeroName}."
