"P685257111" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You are gonna love this!</A>"
// HelloString :
"P4243319716" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Check out what I heard, {HeroName}.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P4215693795" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You are not gonna believe the stuff that is going on.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
