"P3614399731" "Sorry, I got nothing more to tell you about."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1374490598" "Business booming, {HeroName}? Boy, have you got a lot on your plate."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1042310115" "I have something, but it's classified Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1616063779" "You are the kind of pal I am happy to have, {HeroName}. I have access to some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you should find useful. When you need the best stuff, you gotta call me."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P313568878" "You're an inspiration to us all, {HeroName}. Here are some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2021872699" "We are all done, {HeroName}. You're a big fish now."
