"P238271119" "Marvin Weintraub"
// ProfessionString :
"P3592004775" "Technology Expert"
// DescriptionString :
"P3716779665" "Marvin Weintraub is an expert physicist who earned himself a modest fortune in the early nineties, when he designed an experimental energy weapon that became the precursor to today's most powerful laser weapons. Marvin's always been fascinated by military technology, so, once his fortune was secured, he dedicated himself to supporting those heroes who wanted to test out new crime-fighting technologies. Now an advisor to the Paragon City Council, Marvin was part of the large brain trust responsible for designing the city's emergency teleportation network. Still, he considers working with heroes to be his most rewarding job."
// WrongAllianceString :
// HelloString :
"P2751675315" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We have some serious trouble to deal with.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2923180206" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Things are going haywire, as usual.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2109042140" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You won't believe what's happening now.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2692480168" "Sorry, you should really be talking to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3065193773" "Nothing makes me happier than helping heroes catch the bad guys. Well, nothing other than a shiny new gadget, that is. "
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P24518420" "I am all out of action for you, {HeroName}. It's been a pleasure."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1493511896" "No one could call you lazy, {HeroName}. But I think you better work on some of your current tasks before asking for more."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P128067892" "You ought to go out and get to Security Level {Level}. There are some tough missions I'd really like to give you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2008897330" "It is a pleasure working with you, my friend. I have some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you should find useful. If you need anything else, you know who to call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2292811728" "You are the kind of hero that inspired me to work on the teleportation network in the first place, {HeroName}. I have more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> that you might find interesting."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2701227487" "I no longer have anything that would be of interest to you, {HeroName}."
